Subject: [PATCH] arm64ec xstate context transfer

Preserve and transfer requested Windows XSTATE components through the paired Wine protocol.

Source: local macOS Wine queue; see ../../README.md for ancestry and dependencies.
License: ../LICENSE (MIT)

diff --git a/Source/Windows/ARM64EC/Module.cpp b/Source/Windows/ARM64EC/Module.cpp
